  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $p$ : The sun is shining. $q$ : I shall play tennis in the afternoon.\nNegation of $p \\rightarrow q$ is $\\sim(p \\rightarrow q)=p \\wedge \\sim q$",
    "image": null
